<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><b><i>&#160;</i></b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><b><i>Proposal Two</i></b>: Approval of the amendment
to the Company&#8217;s Certificate of Incorporation to increase the authorized shares of Common Stock from 500,000,000 to 1,000,000,000.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

